WEBVTT

00:01.370 --> 00:03.367
kulo mboniso bhanyabhanya ndifuna ukuthetha kancinane malunga

00:03.367 --> 00:07.500
Nokuba kuthwani xakuthethwa nge Prime Number

00:07.500 --> 00:10.094
kwa nalento uzokuyi bona kulo mboniso bhanyabhanya

00:10.110 --> 00:12.608
ngumcimbi nje lo ocacileyo

00:12.608 --> 00:15.302
kodwa njengokuba uqhubekeka kwi kamva lakho lezobalo

00:15.302 --> 00:17.601
uzawukubona ukuba kukho eminye imicimbi ezamekayo noko

00:17.601 --> 00:20.712
enokuthiwa yakhelwe phezulu kwe Prime Number

00:20.712 --> 00:23.359
eminye yayo ibandakanya icebo le cryptography (ukufihlwa kwamanani okanye amagame aze angakwazi ukufundeka)

00:23.359 --> 00:25.612
kwakhona umhlawumbi ezinye zee zitshintsho enokuthi ikhompyutha yakho

00:25.612 --> 00:28.026
izisebenzise ngoku zingakwazi ukwakhelwa phezu kwee Prime Numbers

00:28.026 --> 00:29.931
kodwa ukuba awumazi ukuba u-encryption uthetha ukuthini

00:29.931 --> 00:31.718
ungaxhalabi ngayo loonto ngoku

00:31.718 --> 00:33.785
kumele nje wazi ukuba yintoni nje iPrime Number kuko oko okubalulekileyo.

00:33.785 --> 00:36.966
Koko, ndizawukunika inkcazelo yayo ukuba yintoni

00:36.966 --> 00:39.404
kwaye inkcazelo ingafuna ukubhidisa nje kancinane

00:39.404 --> 00:43.839
kodwa xa siyibona ngemizekeliso inokuba lula kwaye icace

00:43.839 --> 00:49.946
Inani liyi Prime ukuba linjengokuba linjalo

00:49.946 --> 00:57.794
umzekelo, Inye, Zimbini, okanye Zintathu (ukubalwa kwamanani kuqalwa kwelo kuqala)

00:57.794 --> 01:00.488
Okanye ukwanako ukuthi "iPositive intergers"

01:00.488 --> 01:30.962
Ilinani elinjengokuba linjalo elithi lahlulwahlulwe kanye kanye ngamanani amabini anjengokuba enjalo: Inani kwakunye nelokuqala

01:30.962 --> 01:39.823
Lawo ngamanani amabini ethi yahlulwehlulwe ngawo.

01:39.823 --> 01:43.468
Ukuba lento ayenzi mqondo apha kuwe masike senze nje imizekelo

01:43.468 --> 01:46.115
Masikhe sifunise ukuba ingaba amanyee amanani azi Prime numbers okanye hayi.

01:46.115 --> 01:48.948
Masikhe siqale ngamanani angawona akhe amancinane.

01:48.948 --> 01:52.268
Inani lokuqala. Ungathi umhlawumbi inani lokuqala lahluleka kwangelokuqala

01:52.268 --> 01:59.095
kwaye inani lokuqala likwahluleka kwangelokuqala, andithi, inani lokuqala liyi Prime Number

01:59.095 --> 02:02.137
Kodwa khumbula, inxalenye yenkcazelo yethu, ibisithi kufuneka ikwazi ukwahluleka

02:02.137 --> 02:07.803
kanye kanye ngamanani amabini anjengokuba enjalo. Elokuqala likwahluleka ngenani elinjengokuba linjalo elinye, ngenani elilelokuqala.

02:07.803 --> 02:16.673
Lilonke, inani lokuqala, nokuba umhlawumbi linoku chasana nokufunxa kolwazi kungakhange kucingisiswe, ayisililo inali eliyi Prime

02:16.673 --> 02:20.504
Masigqithele siye kwi nani lesibini

02:20.504 --> 02:28.102
lilonke inani lesibini lahluleka ngelokuqalakwakunye kwangalo elesibini, kwaye alahluleki ngelinye inani elingenjengokuba linjalo

02:28.102 --> 02:30.906
ingathi kengoku iyayo nela imibambela yethu.

02:30.906 --> 02:33.948
Lahlula hluleka kanye kanye ngawo amanani amabini anjengokuba enjalo.

02:33.948 --> 02:42.238
Elesibini kwakunye nelokuqala. Ngoko ke inani lesibini liyiyo iPrime

02:42.238 --> 02:52.849
Ndizakuwa kwelela isangqa amanani azi Prime.

02:52.849 --> 02:55.334
Inani lesibini lenza umdla kuba

02:55.334 --> 02:57.818
Lilo lodwa inani eligqagqeneyo elikwayiyo neliyi Prime

02:57.818 --> 03:00.396
Ukuba ke uyayicigisisa lento, nokuba leliphi na inani eligqagqeneyo

03:00.396 --> 03:03.620
lizawukwazi ukwahlula hluleka nge nani lesibini, ngoko ke alizukuba yiyo iPrime

03:03.620 --> 03:06.688
Sizakucinga ngayo loonto kakhulu kwimiboniso bhanyabhanya ezayo.

03:06.688 --> 03:13.144
Masikhe sizame inani lesithathu. Koko, inani lesithathu liyahlula hluleka ngelo kuqala kwangalo elesiThathu

03:13.144 --> 03:15.651
kwaye alikwazi ukwahlula hluleka ngenye into engenye.

03:15.651 --> 03:20.272
alikwazi ukwahlula hluleka ngelesibini. Koko, inani lesithathu likwayiyo iPrime Number

03:20.272 --> 03:25.264
Masizame inani leSine.

03:25.264 --> 03:29.676
Inani leSine liyakwazi ukwahlula hluleka ngenani lokuqala kwangalo eleSine, kodwa

03:29.676 --> 03:36.224
Liyakwazi ukwahlula hluleka kwangalo inani leSibini. Koko, liyahlula hluleka

03:36.224 --> 03:40.311
ngamanani amaThathu anjengokuba enjalo: Elokuqala, EleSibini kwakunye EleSine.

03:40.311 --> 03:44.723
Ngoko, alikwazi ukwanele umlinganiselo wethu wokuba yi Prime

03:44.723 --> 03:48.252
Masizame inani lesiHlanu.

03:48.252 --> 03:51.015
inani lesiHlanu liya kwazi ukwahlula hluleka ngelo kuqala,

03:51.015 --> 03:57.842
alikwazi ukwahlula hluleka ngenani leSibini, lesiThathu okanye leSine

03:57.842 --> 04:01.209
(ungalahlula hlula inani lesiHlanu okanye leSine kodwa uzawukufumana intshiyekela)

04:01.209 --> 04:05.133
kwaye liyakwazi ukwahlula hluleka kwangalo inani lesiHlanu ngokokucacileyo.

04:05.133 --> 04:10.265
kwakhona ke ngoko, inani lesiHlanu liyakwazi ukwahlula hluleka kanye kanye ngawo amanani anjengokuba enjalo: elokuqala kwakunye nelesiHlanu

04:10.265 --> 04:14.235
ngoko kwakhona, inani lesiHlanu liyiyo iPrime. Masiqhubekeke

04:14.235 --> 04:17.393
khonukuze sikwazi ukubona ukuba ikhona na enye indlela apha

04:17.393 --> 04:19.924
kwaye umhlawumbi ndizawukuzama enzinyana

04:19.924 --> 04:26.031
eye ithande ukuwisa abantu. Masizame kengoku inani lesiThandathu

04:26.031 --> 04:34.622
Liyahlula hluleka ngelokuqala, leSibini, lesiThathu kwakunye elesiThandathu

04:34.622 --> 04:37.595
Lilonke inamanani amane anjengokuba enjalo "factors"

04:37.595 --> 04:40.033
Ndicinga ukuba ungakwazi ukutsho nje kanjalo

04:40.033 --> 04:43.005
ukwenzela ukuba ingabi nawo kanye kanye amanani amabini ethi yahlula hluleke ngalo

04:43.005 --> 04:46.743
inamanani amane, koko ayisiyiyo iPrime

04:46.743 --> 04:49.715
Masigqithele kwi nani lesi Xhenxe

04:49.715 --> 04:55.869
Inani lesiXhenxe lahlula hluleka ngenani lokuqala HAYI eleSibini, lesiThathu, leSine, lesihlanu okanye lesiThandathu,

04:55.869 --> 05:00.791
kodwa likwakwazi ukwahlula hluleka ngenani lesi Xhenxe

05:00.791 --> 05:03.624
Lilonke inani lesiXhenxe liyiyo iPrime. Ndicinga ukuba uyayi noko lento

05:03.624 --> 05:06.689
Mangaphi amanani anjengokuba enjalo, amanani anje ngeLokuqala, leSibini, lesiThathu, leSine, lesiHlanu

05:06.689 --> 05:09.383
Amanani othi uwafunde xa uneminyaka emibini ubuncinane

05:09.383 --> 05:11.681
ungalibali inani elingengokho (iqanda) ukwangawadibanisi amanani aziinegative

05:11.681 --> 05:13.980
ukwangawadibanisi amacala kwakunye nawo amanani kwakunye nawo amanani aziirrational

05:13.980 --> 05:15.768
kwaye namanani azii Decimal kwakunye nawo onke amanye

05:15.768 --> 05:18.578
kwakunye nawo nje amanye amanani aziiPositive

05:18.578 --> 05:21.318
ukuba ke unamanani amabini kuphela,

05:21.318 --> 05:23.733
ukuba ke wahlula hluleka ngawe kwakunye ngenani lokuqala

05:23.733 --> 05:25.544
uzakuba yiyo ke iPrime.

05:25.544 --> 05:27.192
kwangohlobo ke endiyicinga ngayo,

05:27.192 --> 05:29.607
ukuba ke asicingi ngemeko ekhethekileyo yenani lokuqala

05:29.607 --> 05:31.604
amanani aziPrime angafaniswa namanani okwakha

05:31.604 --> 05:33.299
awunokwazi ukuwaphula.

05:33.299 --> 05:34.809
Ziphantse zafana neeAtoms.

05:34.809 --> 05:36.285
Ukuba ke uyayicingisisisa ukuba iAtom yintoni

05:36.285 --> 05:38.111
okanye abantu bacinga ukuba iAtom yintoni ekuqaleni

05:38.111 --> 05:39.991
babecinga ukuba zizo ezi zinto

05:39.991 --> 05:41.890
wawungena kwazi ukuzahlula hlula

05:41.890 --> 05:43.986
ngoku ke siyayazi ukuba siyakwazi ukuzahlula hlula iAtoms kwaye futhi

05:43.986 --> 05:46.475
ukuba awuzahluli unokwenza into ekuthiwa luqhushumbo lwe nuclear

05:46.475 --> 05:49.655
kodwa isekwa lelo cebo eli lisemva kwa manani aziiPrime

05:49.655 --> 05:52.618
awukwazi ukuwaphula

05:52.618 --> 05:57.402
abezi zinto ezincinane ngokwamanani anjengokuba enjalo

05:57.402 --> 06:01.256
Amanani anje nge siThandathu uyakwazi ukuthi, inani Isibini uze usi phindaphinde kaThathu,

06:01.256 --> 06:03.717
uyakwazi ukuwaphula kwaye uqaphele ukuba siyawaphula

06:03.717 --> 06:06.411
njenge nani eliphuma kwi nani eliyi Prime

06:06.411 --> 06:08.872
Siye ke saba kuwaphula aba ngamaceba

06:08.872 --> 06:11.217
awukwazi kengoko ukuphinda uwaphule kwakhona

06:11.217 --> 06:14.817
Into onokuyithetha yeyokuba isiXhenxe senziwa linani lokuqala okanye UNYE uze umphindaphinde kasiXhenxe.

06:14.817 --> 06:16.930
kwaye kuleyo ke imeko awukayi phuli kangako

06:16.930 --> 06:19.066
Use nelo nani lisisiXhenxe kwakhona.

06:19.066 --> 06:20.877
inani lesiThandathu uyakwazi ukulaphula

06:20.877 --> 06:23.965
Inani leSine nalo uyakwazi ukulaphula ngokuthi inani leSibini okanye Uzimbini uze umphindaphinde kabini.

06:23.965 --> 06:25.800
Njengoko ke sesiyi susile ke leyo endleleni yethu masicinge ke

06:25.800 --> 06:27.425
ngawo amanani amakhulu kwaye sicinge ngokuba

06:27.425 --> 06:30.072
ingaba loomanani makhulu angamanani aziiPrime

06:30.072 --> 06:34.902
Masizame ke inani leShumi linesiThandathu

06:34.902 --> 06:38.872
Kucacile ke ukuba nokuba leliphi inani elinjengokuba linjalo liyakwazi ukwahlula hluleka ngo Nye (Inani lokuqala) kwaye kwanangalo.

06:38.872 --> 06:42.262
Ngoko ke iShumi elinesiThandathu liyakwazi ukwahlula hluleka ngo Nye kwakunye nangalo iShumi elinesiThadathu.

06:42.262 --> 06:44.143
Ngoko ke uzawukuqala ngenani uZimbini

06:44.143 --> 06:46.071
ngoko ke ukuba uyakwazi ukufumana enye into engenye ethi ingene apha

06:46.071 --> 06:48.207
uzawukwazi ke ukuba ayisiyiyo iPrime

06:48.207 --> 06:51.109
kwaye ke inani eli Shumi elinesiThandathu ungakwazi ukuthi uZimbini uze umphindaphinde kaSibhozo

06:51.109 --> 06:53.362
ungamfumana nango Zine umphindaphinde kaNe

06:53.362 --> 06:55.451
ngoko ke ineton yamanani amancinane

06:55.451 --> 06:57.588
ngaphezu koko nagaphaya kwenani elingu Nye kwakunye neShumi elinesiThandathu.

06:57.588 --> 07:02.278
ngoko ke uShumi elinesiThandathu akayiyo iPrime.

07:02.278 --> 07:06.411
uNye kwakunye neShumi elinesiXhenxe uzakunika ishumi elinesiXhenxe

07:06.411 --> 07:10.846
uZimbini akayi kuShumi elinesiXhenxe, uZintathu akayi ku Zine, Zinhlanu, zintandathu, ZisiXhenxe, ZisiBhozo...

07:10.846 --> 07:14.701
alikho inani ke apho eliphakathi koNye kwakunye noShumielinesiXhenxe

07:14.701 --> 07:21.086
Lilonke ke uShumi elinesiXhenxe uyiyo iPrime

07:21.086 --> 07:23.803
Ngoku ke ndizawukunika engathi inzima

07:23.803 --> 07:26.822
Lena ke yona ingaba bhida abantu abaninzi

07:26.822 --> 07:34.345
Sizakuthini kengoku ngamaShumi Amahlanu anaNye? Ingaba uyi Prime?

07:34.345 --> 07:37.480
kwaye ukuba ke unomdla ungakwazi ukumisa kancinane lomboniso bhanyabhanya apha

07:37.480 --> 07:39.500
kwaye uzame ukuzifunela ngokwakho

07:39.500 --> 07:41.520
ukuba ingaba amaShumi amaHlanu anaNye ayi Prime number

07:41.520 --> 07:45.142
Ukuba ke uyakwazi ukufumana nokuba yeyiphi enye into ngaphandle koNye okanye Amashumi Amahlanu ananye

07:45.142 --> 07:48.161
enokuthi yahlula hluleke kumashumi amahlanu ananye. Kuyabonakala ukuba...

07:48.161 --> 07:50.042
wow linani eli noko elithanda ukunga qheleki

07:50.042 --> 07:52.340
Ungacinga ukuba iyiyo iPrime,

07:52.340 --> 07:54.268
Kodwa ngoku ndizawuku ninika impendulo

07:54.268 --> 07:59.933
Akayiyo iPrime, kuba nayo ayikwazi ukwahlula hluleka ngeSithathu nakwangeShumi elinesiXhenxe

07:59.933 --> 08:02.998
Isithathu ke usiphindaphinde ngeshumi elinesiXhenxe likunika amashumi amahlanu ananye.

08:02.998 --> 08:04.779
ngoko ke ngethemba ukuba lento ikunika ukuqonda okulungileyo

08:04.779 --> 08:06.388
ngokokuba amanani aziiPrime angantoni na

08:06.388 --> 08:09.407
ngokwe themba ke singakunika ukuzilolonga

08:09.407 --> 3:59:59.999
kuyo imiboniso bhanyabhanya kwixa elizayo kwaye umhlawumbi nakuzo ezinye izibalo ezincinane
